Saturday morning I had an idea: paste a YouTube link, extract highlights with auto subtitles.

1. Opened a blank folder with `claude code`, described product requirements;
2. It setup Next.js 15, Stripe billing, Whisper & ffmpeg;
3. When build errors popped up, it self-repaired. Shipped to Vercel in 45 mins;
4. Already banked $3,200 in Stripe subscriptions from indie creators today!

